      "rarity": "uncommon",
      "traits": [
        "consumable"
      ],
      "description": "Activate 1 Strike\nEach of these unassuming sacks contains enough rotting fruit to provide a fungus leshy with 1 week's worth of rations, along with clusters of stones to help press out the fruit's juices. When you Strike a creature with a sack of rotten fruit, the sack is consumed while the creature takes 1d4 bludgeoning damage and must attempt an check (fortitude, dc:15) save. On a failure, the creature is Sickened 1. The range increment of a thrown sack of rotten fruit is 20 feet.",
