      "rarity": "rare",
      "traits": [
        "invested",
        "magical"
      ],
      "description": "This impressive-looking helmet is crafted to resemble the skull of a mighty stag. Although made from bone, the antlers and helm are as strong as iron.\nRather than restrict the senses, a stag's helm enhances them, causing the world to appear in more vibrant colors and significantly enhancing the ambient sounds of the region without making them distracting. While worn, it grants a +1 item bonus to Perception checks.\nActivate F\nFrequency once per day (or once per hour if the wearer worships Erastil)\nEffect Choose a single creature within 30 feet. The stag's helm focuses your aim and grants supernatural insight into your next shot. Your target is Off-Guard to the next ranged Strike you make this turn against them.\nEffect: Stag's Helm",
